{% comment %}
两页 liangye：一个对开就是一次对比。页眉墨线上是标题（宋体 600、sub 档）；版心（双墨线竖带，上鱼尾）把下面分成左右两页：左页旧（小标题与条目都用 ink-2），右页新（ink），条目逐行横排，每行一条 rule-light 界栏。结论在两页之下右对齐，用楷书朱色写成一句批语。条目用 body 档，留给小标题足够的跳跃。
朱色：只有结论的批语。楷书：一处。入场：标题，然后左页、右页依次错峰，批语最后。
{% endcomment %}
<style>
  :scope {
    box-sizing: border-box;
    position: relative;
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
    overflow: hidden;
    padding: var(--ds-space-6) var(--ds-space-7);
    background: var(--ds-color-paper);
    color: var(--ds-color-ink);
    font-family: var(--ds-font-body);
    text-spacing-trim: trim-both;
  }
  :scope::after {
    content: "";
    position: absolute;
    inset: 0;
    pointer-events: none;
    mix-blend-mode: multiply;
    opacity: .45;
    background-image: url("data:image/svg+xml;utf8,<svg xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg' width='240' height='240'><filter id='n'><feTurbulence type='fractalNoise' baseFrequency='.85' numOctaves='3' stitchTiles='stitch'/><feColorMatrix values='0 0 0 0 .30 0 0 0 0 .24 0 0 0 0 .17 0 0 0 .16 0'/></filter><rect width='100%25' height='100%25' filter='url(%23n)'/></svg>");
  }
  p, h1, h2, ol, ul, li, figure, figcaption, blockquote { margin: 0; padding: 0; }
  p, li, blockquote { text-wrap: pretty; }
  h1, h2 { text-wrap: balance; }

  .heading {
    padding-bottom: var(--ds-space-3);
    border-bottom: 2px solid var(--ds-color-ink);
    font-family: var(--ds-font-cjk);
    font-size: var(--ds-type-sub);
    font-weight: 600;
    letter-spacing: .12em;
    line-height: 1.3;
  }
  .spread {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr var(--ds-space-5) 1fr;
    column-gap: var(--ds-space-7);
    margin-top: var(--ds-space-6);
  }
  .side-title {
    font-family: var(--ds-font-cjk);
    font-size: var(--ds-type-head);
    font-weight: 400;
    letter-spacing: .04em;
    line-height: 1.2;
  }
  .points { list-style: none; margin-top: var(--ds-space-5); border-top: 1px solid var(--ds-color-rule); }
  .points li {
    padding: var(--ds-space-3) 0;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--ds-color-rule-light);
    font-size: var(--ds-type-body);
    line-height: 1.5;
  }
  .old { color: var(--ds-color-ink-2); }
  .banxin {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    align-items: center;
    padding-top: var(--ds-space-2);
    border-left: 1px solid var(--ds-color-ink);
    border-right: 1px solid var(--ds-color-ink);
  }
  .yuwei { width: 24px; fill: var(--ds-color-ink); }
  .verdict {
    margin-top: var(--ds-space-6);
    font-family: var(--ds-font-kai);
    font-size: var(--ds-type-lead);
    letter-spacing: .02em;
    line-height: 1.5;
    color: var(--ds-color-zhu);
    text-align: right;
  }
  .verdict:has(> :empty) { display: none; }
</style>
<h1 class="heading" data-ds-enter="fade" data-ds-step="ink" data-ds-ease="ink" data-ds-order="1">{{ slots.heading }}</h1>
<div class="spread">
  <div class="old" data-ds-enter="rise" data-ds-step="glide" data-ds-ease="paper" data-ds-distance="3" data-ds-order="2">
    <h2 class="side-title">{{ slots.leftTitle }}</h2>
    <ul class="points">{% for p in slots.leftPoints %}<li>{{ p }}</li>{% endfor %}</ul>
  </div>
  <div class="banxin" aria-hidden="true"><svg class="yuwei" viewBox="0 0 24 16" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M0 0H24V10L17 5.5L12 11.5L7 5.5L0 10Z"/></svg></div>
  <div class="new" data-ds-enter="rise" data-ds-step="glide" data-ds-ease="paper" data-ds-distance="3" data-ds-order="3">
    <h2 class="side-title">{{ slots.rightTitle }}</h2>
    <ul class="points">{% for p in slots.rightPoints %}<li>{{ p }}</li>{% endfor %}</ul>
  </div>
</div>
<p class="verdict" data-ds-enter="fade" data-ds-step="ink" data-ds-ease="ink" data-ds-order="4">{{ slots.verdict }}</p>
